1
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:39,160
Jensen's on the front page now
老黄又上头条了，

2
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,140
Oh, yeah, yeah!
哦，耶，耶！

3
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:48,360
Wall Street grades his wedding vows
华尔街忙着给他的婚姻打分。

4
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:52,130
Charts go red, the clicks go green
股价往下掉，流量往上蹿，

5
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:56,700
Oh, yeah, yeah!
哦，耶，耶！

6
00:00:56,740 --> 00:01:01,760
Prime-time drama on my screen
科技新闻，硬是演成了八点档。

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,960
He built us fast chips, then lost his own self-control
他让芯片跑得飞快，却没管住自己；

8
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,960
Now suits talk of export control, bless his soul
那帮大佬倒是忙着管——管芯片往哪儿去。

9
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,960
His wife deserves the truth, not a press release
老婆要的是实话，不是一篇公关稿；

10
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,260
But why do chips need the morals police?
可卖个芯片，还得先考思想品德？

11
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:23,520
Save a seat, my friend; fill up his glass, we've got his back
来，给老黄满上，兄弟们都在呢！

12
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:27,340
Jensen Huang, Jensen Huang, let's get back on track
老黄啊，老黄，回来接着干。

13
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:30,820
We asked for fast chips, got a late-night show
本来只想买块好显卡，结果追上了八点档；

14
00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:34,980
They can train on one tweet, then explain things they don't yet know
刷条推文就算出师，啥也不懂也敢开讲。

15
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:38,620
All the big suits still lean on his chips; stop the blame game
大佬们还靠他的芯片吃饭，锅倒是甩得挺快；

16
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:42,780
You can't run your whole cloud on a pile of shame
光靠一堆口水，跑得动你家的服务器？

17
00:01:42,820 --> 00:01:47,020
They can clone a voice, but they still can't clone that man's brain
声音倒是能克隆，老黄这脑子，你们也复制一个试试？

18
00:01:47,060 --> 00:01:51,360
Let him cook; put the boss back in the game
让他继续上菜，老黄，回来露一手！

19
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:12,960
Comments crack the case for free
